-- A selector can legitimately alter more than its primary exact case when a
-- second case depends on the same lower-level production predicate.  Those
-- semantic dependencies are declared literally here.  The impact diagnostic
-- requires every declared label to turn red, while the isolation diagnostic
-- requires every undeclared exact case to remain green; adding a label cannot
-- hide a no-op or an unrelated mutation.
compilerComponentPlanSelectorDependentCaseLabels :: [(String, [String])]
compilerComponentPlanSelectorDependentCaseLabels =
